        "like": 4
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This will be even more important with Udon worlds since as creators we need to be able to tell when a world has issues and what issues it has so that we can improve it. The current report system falls short of this completely. My Camera Test world has an avatars-nudity tag despite not having any avatar pedestals in it and I have no way to judge if those reports are due to some issue with avatar transparency, the world, or something else like people trolling.\nPeople are already making prefabs for people to put in their worlds that allow feedback to be posted from inside the world. Take control of the situation before people start using these in all of their worlds and causing feedback and to be passed through another server out of VRChat's control.\nModeration of these comments is a silly reason to prevent feedback on worlds altogether. Allow people to report comments that are intended to harass, and allow the world owner to either block feedback for the world or make all feedback private.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
