      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Many times I’ve found it very difficult to exit the game and try to find an external method of contacting a world creator to inform them of glitches or broken features or just feedback in general. This feature should be essential with the world creator having rights to delete any TOS violating comments that the system may not pick up on.",
