      "value": "I've been sayin' this for a while. The one big downside is that I have this add-on someone made for SDK2 worlds, and while it is very helpful and I love it, the big problem is the amount of spam and slurs I get in my world as well. But you have to take the bad with the good...it should be something like Jumping in worlds. Optional, but easy to add.",
