      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My thoughts on this idea are that I don't like it that much, but I can understand that some might like to use it as a way to see if there are any problems with the content that they put out. But from my time jumping around public's, I know that this is just going to be used to harass creators more, and if you are going to add something like this, allow the creator to toggle this feature off depending on whether they want it or not. Also, the amount of moderation you would have to put in to keep track of this will be a large undertaking.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
