      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I came to this site for the first time to suggest exactly this! I've been playing VRChat almost solely to explore what people have made and published as worlds. I would love to message creators about their creations which I love; doing so on art websites is a big hobby of mine. About a full day now in time-played, I know the in-game social experience is generally not for me, but for VRChat to realize its potential here as a creative community, not just a video game, would bolster my interest in logging back on greatly. �",
